---
import AdminPageHeader from "../../components/AdminPageHeader.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { chatEnabled } from "../../lib/chat";

// The assistant now lives in the dock on every admin page; this route stays so the
// nav bookmark and the disabled-state explanation keep working.
if (chatEnabled()) return Astro.redirect("/admin", 302);
---
<SiteLayout title="编辑助手" admin>
  <AdminPageHeader title="编辑助手" />
  <section class="panel empty">
    <p>后台聊天助手尚未启用。</p>
    <p><small>在本环境的 <code>web.env</code> 配置 <code>CHAT_ENABLED=true</code>、<code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code> 与 <code>MCP_ENDPOINT_URL</code> 后重启 <code>fripside-web.service</code>。</small></p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
